## Tray icon asset

Create a simple SVG tray icon at `src-tauri/icons/tray.svg`.  Convert to PNG
for the tray (`iconPath` in `tauri.conf.json` accepts PNG).  A plain
whale/container silhouette or a simple square works for v0.1 — aesthetics are
not the goal here.

